                  "quote": "        ):\n            return document\n        raise PermissionDenied(\n            _(\"Insufficient permissions.\"),\n        )"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "statement": "If validation succeeded, serializer creation would assign a random slug and delegate to superclass creation, but the stated target-document authorization failure prevents reaching that effect.",
              "citations": [
